<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Degree Certificate</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: "Times New Roman", serif; margin: 40px; text-align: center; }
    .logo img { width: 100px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .university { font-size: 26px; font-weight: bold; color: #002147; }
    .faculty { font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; color: #333; }
    .title { font-size: 22px; margin: 15px 0; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .content { font-size: 16px; margin: 30px auto; width: 80%; text-align: left; line-height: 1.6; }
    .footer { margin-top: 80px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
    .signature { text-align: right; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="university"><%= universityName %></div>
  <div class="faculty"><%= faculty %></div>
  <div class="title">DEGREE CERTIFICATE</div>

  <div class="content">
    This is to certify that <b><%= studentName %></b>, Register No: <b><%= registerNo %></b>, 
    has successfully completed the <b><%= course %></b> program with <b><%= complementaryCourses %></b>.  

    The candidate has fulfilled all requirements for the award of the <b><%= degree %></b> degree and 
    has been declared to have passed with <b><%= className %></b> class, securing an overall grade of <b><%= grade %></b>.  

    <br><br>
    The program was completed on <b><%= programCompletionDate %></b> and this certificate 
    (No: <b><%= certificateNo %></b>) is issued on <b><%= issueDate %></b>.
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    <div>Seal</div>
    <div class="signature">
      <b><%= viceChancellorName %></b><br>
      Vice Chancellor
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
